<title>UK: EIB ups to 6.0 bln French francs eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB ups to 6.0 bln French francs eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *6.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    08.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  104.573   PAY DATE  **28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    102.998   SPREAD	+1 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*ADDS 1.0 BILLION FRENCH FRANCS</p>
<p>		**PLUS 0.34 PCT ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    MGT/UND    0.30 PCT  SELL CONC  1.575 PCT</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT 2004 OATS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
